<rml>
<head>
<title>Игровая сцена</title>
<link type="text/rcss" href="../kit.rcss"/>
</head>
<body class="gallery">
<div class="g-page">
<div class="g-title">C-Scene</div>
<div class="g-note">land (по умолчанию) на весь экран с дочерним элементом, затем остальные виды: sea · battle · map · deck · tavern · night · title</div>
<div style="width: 100vw; height: 100vh; margin: 0 -16dp 12dp -16dp"><c-scene><div style="position: absolute; left: 16dp; bottom: 16dp">land · дочерний HUD-элемент слева внизу</div><div style="position: absolute; right: 16dp; top: 16dp">справа вверху</div></c-scene></div>
<div class="g-row">
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="sea"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">sea</div></c-scene></div>
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="battle"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">battle</div></c-scene></div>
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="map"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">map</div></c-scene></div>
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="deck"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">deck</div></c-scene></div>
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="tavern"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">tavern</div></c-scene></div>
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="night"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">night</div></c-scene></div>
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="title"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">title</div></c-scene></div>
  <div style="width: 286dp; height: 129dp"><c-scene kind="land"><div style="position: absolute; left: 8dp; top: 8dp">land</div></c-scene></div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
